						"tools": [],
						"text": "The punchy 909 kit is on track 1 of the replica, and a house beat is playing at 124 BPM.\n\n```\nkick       x...x...x...x...\nsnare      ....x.......x...\nclap       ....x.......x...\nclosed hat .x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x\nopen hat   ..x...x...x...x.\n```\n\nIt's a four-on-the-floor kick with the snare and clap layered on beats 2 and 4. The open hats sit on the off-beats, and the closed hats fill in between them. The kick has a hard click and some drive. The hats are short, and the open hat is a little longer.\n\nThe kit is also in the preset maker, where you can download it or install it on your OP-XY."
